  - guid: b9c6148e-87dc-4f1b-a57f-8a9c884edf43
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Catch this, I got a lead on Jessa.
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: 9daacded-d7d4-4ba8-a73c-6f49e986f567
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: She hitched a ride on a cargo run that still comes around today. It's coming out of an agriculture sector not far from here.
      delaySeconds: 2.2
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: b6c8bbf2-7df4-4598-872f-5e336bca58d2
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Dunno where she headed from there, but hey, it's a start.
      delaySeconds: 5.4
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: 7170c492-e294-414e-bd6c-bb5e030be43d
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Maybe I'll even see how your precious potatoes are created.
      delaySeconds: 3
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
  - guid: 7b23e01d-9260-4ffc-951e-2c8247d0b968
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Or... Maybe it's a beef factory...
      delaySeconds: 3.1
    editorPosition: {x: 1300, y: 0}
  - guid: 841f4e4f-9dac-44a4-92d9-fdbfd48f4ce1
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Fuck, I didn't think of that!
